      "content": "Look, you know what I mean. We usually recruit from schools like Stanford, MIT, or the Ivy League. We need people who have been through that kind of intense, competitive environment. Samira went to a local state vocational college. Does that actually put her in the same league as the candidates we usually hire for our high-level engineering roles?",
